sonable. P3 note: Task doesn't restate exact required statement, though Acceptance Criteria mention "风险/Gate 原值写入本 Task" (line 38: "本次用户授权、精确范围与风险/Gate 原值写入本 Task、manifest、Plan、STATUS、Index、P02 parent task" — which is an AC to be done). Since AC line 38 requires writing the risk/Gate original values into the Task, and the Task body omits Build Authorization=AUTHORIZED_WITH_EXCEPTION and the exact statement, this is a P3/P2 internal inconsistency: AC not satisfied by the Task text itself. Hmm, actually AC is an unchecked box (to be completed). The Task is in_review, status in_review. The reviewer should note whether the ACs are achievable/consistent. Since build authorization is a "风险/Gate 原值", its omission while claiming to record original values is a legit P3.

